# reading 3 of kant-practical-3.md by claude-opus-5-5
logic	s5
atom	thcat_forms_only	the theoretic categories of nature are only forms of thought that designate objects indefinitely by universal concepts of every possible intuition
atom	frcat_refer_will	the categories of freedom refer to the determination of a free elective will
atom	will_pure_law	the free elective will has as its foundation a pure practical a priori law
atom	theory_no_pure_law	no concept of the theoretic use of our cognitive faculties has a pure practical a priori law as its foundation
atom	frcat_form_pure_will	the categories of freedom have as their foundation the form of a pure will, given in reason itself
atom	intuition_from_sensibility	the form of intuition (space and time) does not lie in reason but is drawn from sensibility
atom	frcat_advantage	the categories of freedom have an obvious advantage over the theoretic categories
atom	precepts_will_only	all precepts of pure practical reason have to do only with the determination of the will, not with the physical conditions of executing one's purpose
atom	produce_reality	the practical a priori principles themselves produce the reality of that to which they refer (the intention of the will)
atom	theory_produce_reality	theoretical concepts produce the reality of that to which they refer
atom	principles_cognitions	the practical a priori principles in relation to the supreme principle of freedom are at once cognitions and need not wait for intuitions to acquire significance
atom	only_practical	the categories of freedom apply only to the practical reason
atom	ordered	the categories proceed in order from those subject to sensible conditions and morally indeterminate to those free from sensible conditions and determined merely by the moral law
P1	S1	thcat_forms_only	kind conceptual
P2	S1	frcat_refer_will	kind conceptual
P3	S1	will_pure_law	kind conceptual
P4	S1	theory_no_pure_law	kind conceptual
P5	S1	intuition_from_sensibility	kind conceptual
C1	S1	frcat_form_pure_will	from P2 P3
A1	-	frcat_refer_will ∧ will_pure_law → frcat_form_pure_will
P6	S1	thcat_forms_only ∧ frcat_form_pure_will ∧ intuition_from_sensibility → frcat_advantage
C2	S1	frcat_advantage	from P1 C1 P5 P6
P7	S2	precepts_will_only	kind conceptual
P8	S2	produce_reality
P9	S2	¬theory_produce_reality
P10	S2	precepts_will_only ∧ produce_reality → principles_cognitions
C	S2	principles_cognitions	from P7 P8 P10
